99/xhtml"" class=""PRN_ImbeddedAssetReference"" id=""DivAssetPlaceHolder1"">
                <p xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""block core-block"">
                        <a xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" href=""https://mma.prnewswire.com/media/1396534/Schall_Firm_Logo.html"" target=""_blank"" rel=""nofollow"">
                    <div class=""CoreElement__CoreElementWrapper-sc-b54810b7-0 gQea-DY core-image flex items-center justify-center""><span style=""background:none;border:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:initial;margin:0;opacity:1;overflow:hidden;padding:0;width:initial;position:relative;max-width:100%""><span style=""background:none;border:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;height:initial;margin:0;opacity:1;padding:0;width:initial;max-width:100%""><img alt="""" aria-hidden=""true"" src=""data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iNDAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjIyNSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIiB2ZXJzaW9uPSIxLjEiLz4="" style=""background:none;border:0;display:block;height:initial;margin:0;max-width:100%;opacity:1;padding:0;width:initial""/></span><img alt="""" src=""data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7"" decoding=""async"" height=""225"" loading=""lazy"" style=""border:none;bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;height:0;left:0;margin:auto;max-height:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;min-width:100%;padding:0;position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:0;object-fit:contain"" width=""400""/><noscript><img alt="""" fetchPriority=""low"" sizes=""(max-width: 800px) 400px, (min-width: 800px) 400px"" srcSet=""https://mma.prnewswire.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=640,dpr=2,format=auto,quality=85/media/1396534/Schall_Firm_Logo.jpg 1x, https://mma.prnewswire.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=828,dpr=2,format=auto,quality=85/media/1396534/Schall_Firm_Logo.jpg 2x"" src=""https://mma.prnewswire.com/cdn-cgi/image/width=828,dpr=2,format=auto,quality=85/media/1396534/Schall_Firm_Logo.jpg"" decoding=""async"" height=""225"" loading=""lazy"" style=""border:none;bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;height:0;left:0;margin:auto;max-height:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:100%;min-width:100%;padding:0;position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:0;object-fit:contain"" width=""400""/></noscript></span></div>
                        </a>
                </p>

    </div></div><script>$RC(""B:4"",""S:4"")</script><div hidden id=""S:5""><p xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""block core-block"">We also encourage you to contact <span xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""xn-person"">Brian Schall</span> of the Schall Law Firm, 2049 Century Park East, Suite 2460, <span xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""xn-location"">Los Angeles, CA</span> 90067, at 310-301-3335, to discuss your rights free of charge. You can also reach us through the firm&#x27;s website at <u xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""><a xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" href=""https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&amp;l=en&amp;o=4293915-1&amp;h=7853505&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fpr.report%2FmIwBkOrU&amp;a=www.schallfirm.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""nofollow"">www.schallfirm.com</a></u>, or by email at <a xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" href=""/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3153425259505d5d71425259505d5d5758435c1f525e5c"" target=""_blank"" rel=""nofollow""><span class=""__cf_email__"" data-cfemail=""1072637378717c7c50637378717c7c7679627d3e737f7d"">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</p></div><script data-cfasync=""false"" src=""/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js""></script><script>$RC(""B:5"",""S:5"")</script><div hidden id=""S:6""><p xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""block core-block"">According to the Complaint, the Company made false and misleading statements to the market. Iris overstated its prospects in data centers and high-performance computing. The Company&#x27;s overstatements were largely due to the material deficiencies at its facility in <span xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""xn-location"">Childress County, Texas</span>. Based on these facts, the Company&#x27;s public statements were false and materially misleading throughout the class period. When the market learned the truth about Iris, investors suffered damages.</p></div><script>$RC(""B:6"",""S:6"")</script><div hidden id=""S:7""><p xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""block core-block"">The Schall Law Firm<br xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""/><span xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" class=""xn-person"">Brian Schall, Esq.</span>,<br xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""/><a xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" href=""https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0&amp;l=en&amp;o=4293915-1&amp;h=3395674910&amp;u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.schallfirm.com%2F&amp;a=www.schallfirm.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""nofollow"">www.schallfirm.com</a><br xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""/>Office: 310-301-3335<br xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""/><u xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml""><a xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"" href=""/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d7beb9b1b897a4b4bfb6bbbbb1bea5baf9b4b8ba"" target=""_blank"" rel=""nofollow""><span class=""__cf_email__"" data-cfemail=""6801060e07281b0b000904040e011a05460b0705"">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></u></p></div><script data-cfasync=""false"" src=""/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js""></script><script>$RC(""B:7"",""S:7"")</script><div hidden id=""S:8""><div class=""CoreElement__CoreElementWrapper-sc-b54810b7-0 gQea-DY core-image flex items-center justify-center""><span style=""background:none;border:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:initial;margin:0;opacity:1;overflow:hidden;padding:0;width:initial;position:relative;max-width:100%""><span style=""background:none;border:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;height:initial;margin:0;opacity:1;padding:0;width:initial;max-width:100%""><img alt="""" aria-hidden=""true"" src=""data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTIiIGhlaWdodD0iMTIiIHhtbG5zPSJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAwL3N2ZyIgdmVyc2lvbj0iMS4xIi8+"" style=""background:none;border:0;display:block;height:initial;margin:0;max-width:100%;opacity:1;padding:0;width:initial""/></span><img alt="""" src=""data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7"" decodi