 are not represented by an attorney. If you choose to take no action, you can remain an absent class member.\"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}}],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":true,\""innerHTML\"":\""The class, in this case, has not yet been certified, and until certification occurs, you are not represented by an attorney. If you choose to take no action, you can remain an absent class member.\"",\""nodeType\"":1,\""tag\"":\""p\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{\""xmlns\"":\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\""}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":false,\""innerHTML\"":\""According to the Complaint, the Company made false and misleading statements to the market. Iris overstated its prospects in data centers and high-performance computing. The Company's overstatements were largely due to the material deficiencies at its facility in \"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":false,\""innerHTML\"":\""Childress County, Texas\"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}}],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":true,\""innerHTML\"":\""Childress County, Texas\"",\""nodeType\"":1,\""tag\"":\""span\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{\""xmlns\"":\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"",\""className\"":\""xn-location\""}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":false,\""innerHTML\"":\"". Based on these facts, the Company's public statements were false and materially misleading throughout the class period. When the market learned the truth about Iris, investors suffered damages.\"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}}],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":true,\""innerHTML\"":\""According to the Complaint, the Company made false and misleading statements to the market. Iris overstated its prospects in data centers and high-performance computing. The Company's overstatements were largely due to the material deficiencies at its facility in \u003cspan xmlns=\\\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\\\"" class=\\\""xn-location\\\""\u003eChildress County, Texas\u003c/span\u003e. Based on these facts, the Company's public statements were false and materially misleading throughout the class period. When the market learned the truth about Iris, investors suffered damages.\"",\""nodeType\"":1,\""tag\"":\""p\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{\""xmlns\"":\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\""}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":false,\""innerHTML\"":\""Join the case\"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}}],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":true,\""innerHTML\"":\""Join the case\"",\""nodeType\"":1,\""tag\"":\""a\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{\""xmlns\"":\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"",\""href\"":\""https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4293915-1\u0026h=1668954731\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fschallfirm.com%2Fcases%2Firis-energy-limited-2%2F%23case-form\u0026a=Join+the+case\"",\""target\"":\""_blank\"",\""rel\"":\""nofollow\""}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/html\"",\""childBlocks\"":[],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":false,\""innerHTML\"":\"" to recover your losses.\"",\""nodeType\"":3,\""tag\"":\""\"",\""tagAttributes\"":{}}],\""extracted\"":[],\""hasChild\"":true,\""innerHTML\"":\""\u003ca xmlns=\\\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\\\"" href=\\\""https://c212.net/c/link/?t=0\u0026l=en\u0026o=4293915-1\u0026h=1668954731\u0026u=https%3A%2F%2Fschallfirm.com%2Fcases%2Firis-energy-limited-2%2F%23case-form\u0026a=Join+the+case\\\"" target=\\\""_blank\\\"" rel=\\\""nofollow\\\""\u003eJoin the case\u003c/a\u003e to recover your losses.\"",\""nodeType\"":1,\""tag\"":\""p\"",\""tag