5/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX.jpg\""},\""medium\"":{\""height\"":200,\""width\"":300,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-300x200.jpg\""},\""large\"":{\""height\"":683,\""width\"":1024,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-1024x683.jpg\""},\""thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":150,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-150x150.jpg\""},\""medium_large\"":{\""height\"":512,\""width\"":768,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-768x512.jpg\""},\""Multi Rating Pro Thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":100,\""width\"":100,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-100x100.jpg\""},\""slideshow-img\"":{\""height\"":600,\""width\"":900,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-900x600.jpg\""},\""web-stories-poster-portrait\"":{\""height\"":784,\""width\"":640,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-640x784.jpg\""},\""web-stories-publisher-logo\"":{\""height\"":96,\""width\"":96,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-96x96.jpg\""},\""web-stories-thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":100,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/29085739/Lithium-EnergyX-150x100.jpg\""}}}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eGeneral Motors already invested.\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003eNow, you have the chance to join them as an early-stage shareholder.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""General Motors already invested.\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c/strong\u003eNow, you have the chance to join them as an early-stage shareholder.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eDemand for lithium is fueling a modern-day gold rush.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Demand for lithium is fueling a modern-day gold rush.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThe industries that define our modern world, like AI, robotics, EVs, and energy, all depend on lithium. In fact, Microsoft CEO, Satya Nadella believes that the AI race will be won based on energy costs, not on who has the best models.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThat’s why lithium demand is projected to grow a staggering 5X by 2040.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""The industries that define our modern world, like AI, robotics, EVs, and energy, all depend on lithium. In fact, Microsoft CEO, Satya Nadella believes that the AI race will be won based on energy costs, not on who has the best models.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThat’s why lithium demand is projected to grow a staggering 5X by 2040.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThat growth is an opportunity for investors. As Elon Musk bluntly put it, “Do you like minting money? Well, the lithium business is for you.”*\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""That growth is an opportunity for investors. As Elon Musk bluntly put it, “Do you like minting money? Well, the lithium business is for you.”*\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eOne company translated this demand into substantial valuation growth since 2018, officially reaching the $1B unicorn territory last year.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""One company translated this demand into substantial valuation growth since 2018, officially reaching the $1B unicorn territory last year.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eMeet \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/energyxgoldrush/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eEnergyX\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Meet \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/energyxgoldrush/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eEnergyX\u003c/a\u003e. \"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThey have developed patented technology that can recover up to 3X more lithium than traditional methods. That breakthrough has already earned them over $150M in investments, including strategic investment and partnership from General Motors and POSCO, and a $5M U.S. Department of Energy grant.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""They have developed patented technology that can recover up to 3X more lithium than traditional methods. That breakthrough has already earned them over $150M in investments, including strategic investment and partnership from General Motors and POSCO, and a $5M U.S. Department of Energy grant.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""attrs\"":{\""name\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""data\"":{\""title\"":\""\"",\""mobile_items\"":1,\""display\"":\""advertorial\"",\""compact_mode\"":false,\""social_proofing\"":\""\"",\""limit_aol_items\"":-1,\""groups\"":[{\""title\"":\""Join 40,000+ Investors Backing Next-Gen Lithium Extraction at $13/Share\"",\""button_text\"":\""Invest Now\"",\""description\"":\""EnergyX's patented tech recovers 3x more lithium in days, not months. Backed by GM and a $5M DOE grant, they're scaling to commercial production. Invest starting at $1,000.\"",\""image_url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/04092309/energyx-logo.jpeg\"