ion plant \u003c/strong\u003eis now commissioned in Texas, the largest direct lithium extraction facility in the U.S.\u003c/li\u003e\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eWith proven tech and resources, mounting institutional support, a market poised for major growth, and new verticals emerging, the opportunity for investors today couldn’t be better timed.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""With proven tech and resources, mounting institutional support, a market poised for major growth, and new verticals emerging, the opportunity for investors today couldn’t be better timed.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThis is your chance to claim your stake in a private unicorn alongside General Motors, POSCO, and over 40,000 everyday investors.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""This is your chance to claim your stake in a private unicorn alongside General Motors, POSCO, and over 40,000 everyday investors.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eGet your piece in this modern-day gold rush before the deadline.\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/energyxgoldrush/displaywidget/\\\""\u003e Become an early-stage EnergyX shareholder at the current price while you still can.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Get your piece in this modern-day gold rush before the deadline.\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/energyxgoldrush/displaywidget/\\\""\u003e Become an early-stage EnergyX shareholder at the current price while you still can.\u003c/a\u003e\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""attrs\"":{\""name\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""data\"":{\""title\"":\""\"",\""mobile_items\"":1,