, Uranium, and More\"",\""post_type\"":\""advertorial\"",\""robots\"":\""noindex\"",\""intro\"":null,\""slug\"":\""the-demand-for-rare-and-precious-metals-is-rising-this-web-app-gives-investors-direct-24-7-access-to-gold-uranium-and-more-2\"",\""template\"":\""money\"",\""canonical_link\"":\""https://www.benzinga.com/money/advertorial/the-demand-for-rare-and-precious-metals-is-rising-this-web-app-gives-investors-direct-24-7-access-to-gold-uranium-and-more-2\"",\""image\"":null,\""taxonomies\"":[],\""parent\"":[],\""meta\"":{\""title\"":\""The Demand for Rare and Precious Metals is Rising. This Web App Gives Investors Direct, 24/7 Access to Gold, Uranium, and More\"",\""description\"":\""\"",\""image\"":null,\""author\"":\""Benzinga Contributors\"",\""authorSlug\"":\""benzinga-contributors\"",\""postId\"":382207,\""publishedDate\"":\""2026-04-20T06:51:47.000000Z\"",\""modifiedDate\"":\""2026-04-20T06:51:49.000000Z\"",\""verifiedUserSlug\"":null,\""verifiedBy\"":null,\""editedUserSlug\"":null,\""editedBy\"":null,\""hrefLanguage\"":\""en\""},\""breadcrumbs\"":[{\""id\"":382207,\""href\"":\""/the-demand-for-rare-and-precious-metals-is-rising-this-web-app-gives-investors-direct-24-7-access-to-gold-uranium-and-more-2\"",\""name\"":\""The Demand for Rare and Precious Metals is Rising. This Web App Gives Investors Direct, 24/7 Access to Gold, Uranium, and More\""}],\""blocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/image\"",\""attrs\"":{\""align\"":\""center\"",\""id\"":379533,\""sizeSlug\"":\""large\"",\""linkDestination\"":\""none\"",\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cfigure class=\\\""wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\\\""\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-1024x573.jpg\\\"" alt=\\\""\\\"" class=\\\""wp-image-379533\\\""/\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\\n\"",\""image\"":{\""image_id\"":379533,\""attachment_id\"":379533,\""title\"":\""IMG_9316\"",\""caption\"":\""\"",\""sizes\"":{\""original\"":{\""height\"":671,\""width\"":1200,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316.jpg\""},\""medium\"":{\""height\"":168,\""width\"":300,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-300x168.jpg\""},\""large\"":{\""height\"":573,\""width\"":1024,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-1024x573.jpg\""},\""thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":150,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-150x150.jpg\""},\""medium_large\"":{\""height\"":429,\""width\"":768,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-768x429.jpg\""},\""Multi Rating Pro Thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":100,\""width\"":100,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-100x100.jpg\""},\""slideshow-img\"":{\""height\"":600,\""width\"":900,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-900x600.jpg\""},\""web-stories-poster-portrait\"":{\""height\"":671,\""width\"":640,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-640x671.jpg\""},\""web-stories-publisher-logo\"":{\""height\"":96,\""width\"":96,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-96x96.jpg\""},\""web-stories-thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":84,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18102829/IMG_9316-150x84.jpg\""}}}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThe demand for rare earth and precious metals has intensified, driven on one hand by industrial applications and on the other by investors seeking portfolio diversification amid economic uncertainty.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""The demand for rare earth and precious metals has intensified, driven on one hand by industrial applications and on the other by investors seeking portfolio diversification amid economic uncertainty.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThe U.S. governmentʼs establishment of a U.S. critical mineral reserve has brought further attention to precious metals, which are essential to modern manufacturing and used in everything from smartphones to wind turbines and fighter jets.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExisting options to invest directly in these metals — such as ETFs, managed funds, company stocks, etc. — often have limitations, including regional restrictions, strict trading hours, high entry barriers, and minimum purchase requirements.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""The U.S. governmentʼs establishment of a U.S. critical mineral reserve has brought further attention to precious metals, which are essential to modern manufacturing and used in everything from smartphones to wind turbines and fighter jets.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExisting options to invest directly in these metals — such as ETFs, managed funds, company stocks, etc. — often have limitations, including regional restrictions, strict trading hours, high entry barriers, and minimum purchase requirements.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eInvestors are often provided only with indirect exposure and must depend on asset managers or specific platforms, exchanges, or brokerages to invest in each metal.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Investors are often provided only with indirect exposure and must depend on asset managers or specific platforms, exchanges, or brokerages to invest in each metal.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e removes those traditional barriers to investing in metals, providing individual investors 24/7 global access to rare earth metals, critical metals, gold, uranium, and more. \u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e removes those traditional barriers to investing in metals, providing individual investors 24/7 global access to rare earth metals, critical metals, gold, uranium, and more. \"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""attrs\"":{\""name\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""data\"":{\""title\"":\""\"",\""mobile_items\"":1,\""display\"":\""advertorial\"",\""compact_mode\"":false,\""social_proofing\"":\""\"",\""limit_aol_items\"":-1,\""groups\"":[{\""title\"":\""Invest in Tokenized Precious Metals 24/7 with No Minimums\"",\""button_text\"":\""Learn More\"",\""description\"":\""Metals.io lets investors own tokenized gold, uranium, and rare earth metals with 24/7 global access and no minimums.\"",\""image_url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/30164027/Metals.io-Logo.jpeg\"",\""url\"":\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\"",\""highlight_list\"":[],\""review\"":\""Promoted by Metals.io\"",\""disable_disclosure\"":false,\""advertorial_id\"":false,\""review_url\"":\""https://www.benzinga.com/partner-disclosure/trilitech-design-ltd-partner-disclosure\""}]},\""align\"":\""\"",\""mode\"":\""edit\""},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy You Should Invest in Metals With Metals.io\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h2\"",\""id\"":\""why-you-should-invest-in-metals-with-metalsio\"",\""html\"":\""\u003cstrong\u003eWhy You Should Invest in Metals With Metals.io\u003c/strong\u003e\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e offers multiple advantages designed to improve accessibility and portfolio management for metals investments. \u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e offers multiple advantages designed to improve accessibility and portfolio management for metals investments. \"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""level\"":3,\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTokenized metals\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h3\"",\""id\"":\""tokenized-metalsnbsp\"",\""html\"":\""\u003cstrong\u003eTokenized metals\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eMetals.io enables direct ownership of physical metals through blockchain-powered tokenization.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Metals.io enables direct ownership of physical metals through blockchain-powered tokenization.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eEach token acts like a “warehouse receipt,” proving that you have ownership of physical assets stored on your behalf by a trusted provider, while removing many of the limitations of traditional commodity investments, such as high minimum purchase requirements, limited transparency, restricted trading hours, counterparty risk, and high management fees.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Each token acts like a “warehouse receipt,” proving that you have ownership of physical assets stored on your behalf by a trusted provider, while removing many of the limitations of traditional commodity investments, such as high minimum purchase requirements, limited transparency, restricted trading hours, counterparty risk, and high management fees.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e has zero asset management fees, no minimum purchase requirement, reduced counterparty risk, and is independently audited. \u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""\u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e has zero asset management fees, no minimum purchase requirement, reduced counterparty risk, and is independently audited. \"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eTokenized metals also offer the advantages of digital assets, including fractional ownership, divisibility, fungibility, and 24/7 global tradability.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Tokenized metals also offer the advantages of digital assets, including fractional ownership, divisibility, fungibility, and 24/7 global tradability.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""level\"":3,\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA unified metals portfolio:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h3\"",\""id\"":\""a-unified-metals-portfolionbsp\"",\""html\"":\""\u003cstrong\u003eA unified metals portfolio:\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eMetals.io enables investors to manage their metals portfolio within a single, unified view, providing real-time visibility.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Metals.io enables investors to manage their metals portfolio within a single, unified view, providing real-time visibility.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eInvestors also get stronger risk management through simplified tracking and oversight and centralized portfolio management that empowers investors to manage their metals holdings with greater ease and control. Additionally, the platform helps investors discover, understand, and access new metals, supporting broader portfolio diversification.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Investors also get stronger risk management through simplified tracking and oversight and centralized portfolio management that empowers investors to manage their metals holdings with greater ease and control. Additionally, the platform helps investors discover, understand, and access new metals, supporting broader portfolio diversification.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""level\"":3,\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch3\u003eStrong foundations\u003c/h3\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h3\"",\""id\"":\""strong-foundations\"",\""html\"":\""Strong foundations\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eEach metal available on \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/metalsiooutboundlick/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eMetals.io\u003c/a\u003e is powered by industry-leading partners and an experienced team from the world of commodities, blockchain, and finance:\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Each metal available on \u003ca href=\\\""https:/