e\"",\""advertorial\"":{\""id\"":384566,\""title\"":\""Rents Are Rising In These Low-Supply Markets. Now Investors Can Access Thesis-Driven  Multifamily Investing Through  Lightstone, a $12B AUM Operator\"",\""post_type\"":\""advertorial\"",\""robots\"":\""noindex\"",\""intro\"":null,\""slug\"":\""rents-are-rising-in-these-low-supply-markets-now-investors-can-access-thesis-driven-multifamily-investing-through-lightstone-a-12b-aum-operator\"",\""template\"":\""money\"",\""canonical_link\"":\""https://www.benzinga.com/money/advertorial/rents-are-rising-in-these-low-supply-markets-now-investors-can-access-thesis-driven-multifamily-investing-through-lightstone-a-12b-aum-operator\"",\""image\"":null,\""taxonomies\"":[],\""parent\"":[],\""meta\"":{\""title\"":\""Rents Are Rising In These Low-Supply Markets. Now Investors Can Access Thesis-Driven  Multifamily Investing Through  Lightstone, a $12B AUM Operator\"",\""description\"":\""\"",\""image\"":null,\""author\"":\""Benzinga Contributors\"",\""authorSlug\"":\""benzinga-contributors\"",\""postId\"":384566,\""publishedDate\"":\""2026-05-20T05:02:50.000000Z\"",\""modifiedDate\"":\""2026-05-20T05:02:51.000000Z\"",\""verifiedUserSlug\"":null,\""verifiedBy\"":null,\""editedUserSlug\"":null,\""editedBy\"":null,\""hrefLanguage\"":\""en\""},\""breadcrumbs\"":[{\""id\"":384566,\""href\"":\""/rents-are-rising-in-these-low-supply-markets-now-investors-can-access-thesis-driven-multifamily-investing-through-lightstone-a-12b-aum-operator\"",\""name\"":\""Rents Are Rising In These Low-Supply Markets. Now Investors Can Access Thesis-Driven  Multifamily Investing Through  Lightstone, a $12B AUM Operator\""}],\""blocks\"":[{\""blockName\"":\""core/image\"",\""attrs\"":{\""align\"":\""center\"",\""id\"":383878,\""sizeSlug\"":\""large\"",\""linkDestination\"":\""none\"",\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cfigure class=\\\""wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\\\""\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-1024x575.jpeg\\\"" alt=\\\""\\\"" class=\\\""wp-image-383878\\\""/\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e\\n\"",\""image\"":{\""image_id\"":383878,\""attachment_id\"":383878,\""title\"":\""IMG_9553\"",\""caption\"":\""\"",\""sizes\"":{\""original\"":{\""height\"":674,\""width\"":1200,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553.jpeg\""},\""medium\"":{\""height\"":169,\""width\"":300,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-300x169.jpeg\""},\""large\"":{\""height\"":575,\""width\"":1024,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-1024x575.jpeg\""},\""thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":150,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-150x150.jpeg\""},\""medium_large\"":{\""height\"":431,\""width\"":768,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-768x431.jpeg\""},\""Multi Rating Pro Thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":100,\""width\"":100,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-100x100.jpeg\""},\""slideshow-img\"":{\""height\"":600,\""width\"":900,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-900x600.jpeg\""},\""web-stories-poster-portrait\"":{\""height\"":674,\""width\"":640,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-640x674.jpeg\""},\""web-stories-publisher-logo\"":{\""height\"":96,\""width\"":96,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-96x96.jpeg\""},\""web-stories-thumbnail\"":{\""height\"":84,\""width\"":150,\""url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114405/IMG_9553-150x84.jpeg\""}}}},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eHow should individual accredited investors approach private-market real estate investing in 2026? In a market with higher potential inflation and volatility, multifamily is once again in focus.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""How should individual accredited investors approach private-market real estate investing in 2026? In a market with higher potential inflation and volatility, multifamily is once again in focus.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThe multifamily opportunity in 2026 is best understood not as a broad call to apartments, but as a selective thesis built on pronounced dispersion across geographies, product types, and strategies.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""The multifamily opportunity in 2026 is best understood not as a broad call to apartments, but as a selective thesis built on pronounced dispersion across geographies, product types, and strategies.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eFor one, high mortgage interest rates and other factors have caused renting to be the more realistic housing option for many; CBRE reports a 105% monthly premium to buy versus rent, showing the renter pool continues to expand.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""For one, high mortgage interest rates and other factors have caused renting to be the more realistic housing option for many; CBRE reports a 105% monthly premium to buy versus rent, showing the renter pool continues to expand.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eAt the same time, the development cycle is cooling: per NAHB, multifamily starts are expected to fall to 392,000 units in 2026 and 367,000 in 2027, after completions reached a 38-year high of 608,000 units in 2024.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""At the same time, the development cycle is cooling: per NAHB, multifamily starts are expected to fall to 392,000 units in 2026 and 367,000 in 2027, after completions reached a 38-year high of 608,000 units in 2024.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThat combination supports a more selective investment strategy: favor markets where rent growth remains positive, supply is more metered, and rent growth potential is less exposed to luxury lease-up competition.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""That combination supports a more selective investment strategy: favor markets where rent growth remains positive, supply is more metered, and rent growth potential is less exposed to luxury lease-up competition.\u0026nbsp;\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eWith a diverse national portfolio of more than 25,000 multifamily units and a 40 year operating history, \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone\u003c/a\u003e has earned a reputation for identifying innovative and untapped opportunities in multifamily real estate. Leveraging their footprint, Lightstone has unrivaled insights into macro fundamentals to inform underwriting decisions based on actual data.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""With a diverse national portfolio of more than 25,000 multifamily units and a 40 year operating history, \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone\u003c/a\u003e has earned a reputation for identifying innovative and untapped opportunities in multifamily real estate. Leveraging their footprint, Lightstone has unrivaled insights into macro fundamentals to inform underwriting decisions based on actual data.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eWhat’s more, Lightstone coinvests a minimum of 20% in each \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone DIRECT deal\u003c/a\u003e, aligning their outcomes with investors.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""What’s more, Lightstone coinvests a minimum of 20% in each \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone DIRECT deal\u003c/a\u003e, aligning their outcomes with investors.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eHighly sought-after multifamily investments are now within reach.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Highly sought-after multifamily investments are now within reach.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""attrs\"":{\""name\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""data\"":{\""title\"":\""\"",\""mobile_items\"":1,\""display\"":\""advertorial\"",\""compact_mode\"":false,\""social_proofing\"":\""\"",\""limit_aol_items\"":-1,\""groups\"":[{\""title\"":\""Invest Alongside a $12B+ Multifamily Operator With a 40-Year Track Record\"",\""button_text\"":\""Invest Now\"",\""description\"":\""Lightstone manages 25,000+ apartments, posted 5.8% NOI growth in 2025, and coinvests 20% in every deal. Accredited investors can now access the same opportunities.\"",\""image_url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114928/IMG_9554.jpg\"",\""url\"":\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\"",\""highlight_list\"":[],\""review\"":\""\"",\""disable_disclosure\"":false,\""advertorial_id\"":false,\""review_url\"":\""\""}]},\""align\"":\""\"",\""mode\"":\""edit\""},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Geography Matters More Than Ever\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h2\"",\""id\"":\""why-geography-matters-more-than-evernbspnbspnbsp\"",\""html\"":\""Why Geography Matters More Than Ever\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eEffective asking rents posted consecutive monthly gains in February 2026, per RealPage, but performance was highly uneven across regions.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Effective asking rents posted consecutive monthly gains in February 2026, per RealPage, but performance was highly uneven across regions.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThe Midwest led with 2.0% annual rent growth in February 2026 and the Northeast followed at 1.5%, while the South was flat and the West was down 1.4%.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""The Midwest led with 2.0% annual rent growth in February 2026 and the Northeast followed at 1.5%, while the South was flat and the West was down 1.4%.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThat pattern is consistent across every major data provider: rents in high-supply markets like the Sun Belt and Western regions are expected to lag behind pre-pandemic levels, while low-supply markets like the Midwest and Northeast will see increases.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""That pattern is consistent across every major data provider: rents in high-supply markets like the Sun Belt and Western regions are expected to lag behind pre-pandemic levels, while low-supply markets like the Midwest and Northeast will see increases.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eIn practical terms, the Midwest’s current advantage means lower competitive pressure from new deliveries, fewer concessions, and a healthier balance between demand and available supply. For investors, those conditions can produce a more durable cash-flow profile than markets where new luxury products are still clearing.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""In practical terms, the Midwest’s current advantage means lower competitive pressure from new deliveries, fewer concessions, and a healthier balance between demand and available supply. For investors, those conditions can produce a more durable cash-flow profile than markets where new luxury products are still clearing.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eOf Lightstone’s 25,000+ multifamily units under management, 14,304 units are in the Midwest and 10,325 are in Michigan*. This concentration directly aligns with the regions where first- and third-party data show healthier rent performance and less severe supply pressure.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Of Lightstone’s 25,000+ multifamily units under management, 14,304 units are in the Midwest and 10,325 are in Michigan*. This concentration directly aligns with the regions where first- and third-party data show healthier rent performance and less severe supply pressure.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/heading\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003ch2\u003eThe Lightstone DIRECT Advantage\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\"",\""tag\"":\""h2\"",\""id\"":\""the-lightstone-d-i-r-e-c-t-advantagenbsp\"",\""html\"":\""The Lightstone DIRECT Advantage\u0026nbsp;\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eIn 2025, Lightstone’s multifamily portfolio averaged 94% occupancy, posted 2.7% year-over-year rent growth, and delivered 5.8% year-over-year NOI growth. Critically, Lightstone is a vertically integrated owner/operator, with asset management and property management team in-house. Individual investors on \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone DIRECT\u003c/a\u003e benefit from this approach when investing in the same multifamily opportunities Lightstone pursues with its own capital.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""In 2025, Lightstone’s multifamily portfolio averaged 94% occupancy, posted 2.7% year-over-year rent growth, and delivered 5.8% year-over-year NOI growth. Critically, Lightstone is a vertically integrated owner/operator, with asset management and property management team in-house. Individual investors on \u003ca href=\\\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\\\""\u003eLightstone DIRECT\u003c/a\u003e benefit from this approach when investing in the same multifamily opportunities Lightstone pursues with its own capital.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eThis operating record demonstrates Lightstone is already executing in the lane this market is rewarding: regional concentration, operating scale, renovation throughput, rent progression, and disciplined debt structure.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""This operating record demonstrates Lightstone is already executing in the lane this market is rewarding: regional concentration, operating scale, renovation throughput, rent progression, and disciplined debt structure.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eWith Lightstone DIRECT, accredited individuals can access the same multifamily opportunities that Lightstone pursues with its own capital.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""With Lightstone DIRECT, accredited individuals can access the same multifamily opportunities that Lightstone pursues with its own capital.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003eInvestors work with a well-established real estate firm with $12B+ in assets under management and a four decade real estate track record that includes operating through multiple recessions, credit crises, and recoveries.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""Investors work with a well-established real estate firm with $12B+ in assets under management and a four decade real estate track record that includes operating through multiple recessions, credit crises, and recoveries.\"",\""tag\"":\""p\""},{\""blockName\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""attrs\"":{\""name\"":\""acf/call-to-action-stacked-slider\"",\""data\"":{\""title\"":\""\"",\""mobile_items\"":1,\""display\"":\""advertorial\"",\""compact_mode\"":false,\""social_proofing\"":\""\"",\""limit_aol_items\"":-1,\""groups\"":[{\""title\"":\""Invest Alongside a $12B+ Multifamily Operator With a 40-Year Track Record\"",\""button_text\"":\""Invest Now\"",\""description\"":\""Lightstone manages 25,000+ apartments, posted 5.8% NOI growth in 2025, and coinvests 20% in every deal. Accredited investors can now access the same opportunities.\"",\""image_url\"":\""https://cdnwp-s3.benzinga.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/12114928/IMG_9554.jpg\"",\""url\"":\""https://www.clkmg.com/zing/outboundlightstone/displaywidget/\"",\""highlight_list\"":[],\""review\"":\""\"",\""disable_disclosure\"":false,\""advertorial_id\"":false,\""review_url\"":\""\""}]},\""align\"":\""\"",\""mode\"":\""edit\""},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\""},{\""blockName\"":\""core/paragraph\"",\""attrs\"":{\""data\"":[]},\""innerBlocks\"":[],\""innerHTML\"":\""\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e*As of 12/31/2025\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\\n\"",\""html\"":\""\u003cem\u003e*As of 1