            <h1 class=""article-headline"" itemprop=""headline"" >BEHIND A WIRE FENCE is a Love Letter to Minor League Baseball—Especially for New Yorkers Who Loved the Game in the 90s</h1>

                <h2 class=""article-sub-headline"" itemprop=""alternativeHeadline"" >Palmetto Publishing’s latest nonfiction release explores the pivotal season of 1993 in minor league baseball, following dozens of exciting games and over fifty players who went on to play Major League ball.</h2>



<p class=""article-published-source"" style=""min-height: 46px; min-width: 700px;"">


    <span class=""justify-content-start"">
        <span class=""article-published"" itemprop=""datePublished"">
            <time datetime=""2024-11-19T18:00:00Z"">November 19, 2024 13:00 ET</time>
        </span>

        <span class=""article-source"" style=""min-width: 260px;"" itemprop=""sourceOrganization"" itemscope itemtype=""http://schema.org/Organization"">
            <span>&nbsp;</span>| Source:
            <span>

                <a href=""/en/search/organization/Palmetto%2520Publishing"" itemprop=""name"">Palmetto Publishing</a>
            </span>

        </span>
    </span>

    <span id=""pnr-global-follow-button"" class=""pnr-follow-button-width-height""></span>

    <span itemprop=""author copyrightHolder"" itemscope itemtype=""http://schema.org/Organization"" style=""display: none;"">
        <span itemprop=""name"">Palmetto Publishing</span>
    </span>

    

</p>

<script type=""text/javascript"">
    window.pnrApplicationSettings.articleSideBarSettings.orgDetails = {
            location : '',
            name : ""Palmetto Publishing"",
            website : 'https://www.palmettopublishing.com',
            industryName: '',
