ialog"" aria-expanded=""false"" aria-controls=""radix-_R_2djminr5ubmivb_"" data-state=""closed"" data-slot=""dialog-trigger""><svg xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" width=""24"" height=""24"" viewBox=""0 0 24 24"" fill=""none"" stroke=""currentColor"" stroke-width=""2"" stroke-linecap=""round"" stroke-linejoin=""round"" class=""lucide lucide-share2 text-royal-purple-800 size-4""><circle cx=""18"" cy=""5"" r=""3""></circle><circle cx=""6"" cy=""12"" r=""3""></circle><circle cx=""18"" cy=""19"" r=""3""></circle><line x1=""8.59"" x2=""15.42"" y1=""13.51"" y2=""17.49""></line><line x1=""15.41"" x2=""8.59"" y1=""6.51"" y2=""10.49""></line></svg><span>Share</span></button><div class=""hidden h-10 w-px bg-gray-300 md:block"" aria-hidden=""true""></div><div class=""relative""><button class=""text-gray-1100 text-md flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-cyan-800 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"" aria-label=""Summarize with AI"" type=""button"" aria-haspopup=""dialog"" aria-expanded=""false"" aria-controls=""radix-_R_4djminr5ubmivb_"" data-state=""closed"" data-slot=""popover-trigger""><svg xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" width=""24"" height=""24"" viewBox=""0 0 24 24"" fill=""none"" stroke=""currentColor"" stroke-width=""2"" stroke-linecap=""round"" stroke-linejoin=""round"" class=""lucide lucide-sparkles text-royal-purple-800 h-4 w-4""><path d=""M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z""></path><path d=""M20 3v4""></path><path d=""M22 5h-4""></path><path d=""M4 17v2""></path><path d=""M5 18H3""></path></svg>Summarize with AI<svg xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" width=""24"" height=""24"" viewBox=""0 0 24 24"" fill=""none"" stroke=""currentColor"" stroke-width=""2"" stroke-linecap=""round"" stroke-linejoin=""round"" class=""lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4""><path d=""m6 9 6 6 6-6""></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=""shadow-card mt-[8px] mb-4 bg-white p-5 text-gray-800""><h2 class=""mb-2 text-lg font-bold uppercase"">Key Points</h2><ul class=""font-medium""><li class=""my-2 flex leading-tight""><div class=""mt-0.5 mr-2 w-4""><svg width=""14"" height=""15"" viewBox=""0 0 14 15"" fill=""none"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><path d=""M14 5.58984C14 2.91016 11.8398 0.75 9.16016 0.75C6.50781 0.777344 4.375 2.91016 4.375 5.5625C4.375 6.10938 4.45703 6.60156 4.59375 7.09375L0.191406 11.4961C0.0546875 11.6328 0 11.7969 0 11.9609V14.0938C0 14.4766 0.273438 14.75 0.65625 14.75H3.71875C4.07422 14.75 4.375 14.4766 4.375 14.0938V13H5.46875C5.82422 13 6.125 12.7266 6.125 12.3438V11.25H7.13672C7.30078 11.25 7.51953 11.168 7.62891 11.0312L8.28516 10.293C8.55859 10.3477 8.85938 10.375 9.1875 10.375C11.8398 10.375 14 8.24219 14 5.58984Z"" fill=""#FFB81C""></path></svg></div><div>D-Wave's claim of solving a ""useful, real-world problem"" boosted stock prices despite scientific skepticism.</div></li><li class=""my-2 flex leading-tight""><div class=""mt-0.5 mr-2 w-4""><svg width=""14"" height=""15"" viewBox=""0 0 14 15"" fill=""none"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><path d=""M14 5.58984C14 2.91016 11.8398 0.75 9.16016 0.75C6.50781 0.777344 4.375 2.91016 4.375 5.5625C4.375 6.10938 4.45703 6.60156 4.59375 7.09375L0.191406 11.4961C0.0546875 11.6328 0 11.7969 0 11.9609V14.0938C0 14.4766 0.273438 14.75 0.65625 14.75H3.71875C4.07422 14.75 4.375 14.4766 4.375 14.0938V13H5.46875C5.82422 13 6.125 12.7266 6.125 12.3438V11.25H7.13672C7.30078 11.25 7.51953 11.168 7.62891 11.0312L8.28516 10.293C8.55859 10.3477 8.85938 10.375 9.1875 10.375C11.8398 10.375 14 8.24219 14 5.58984Z"" fill=""#FFB81C""></path></svg></div><div>Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's comments about quantum computing unleashed heavy volatility on March 20, but the moves were modest by day's end.</div></li><li class=""my-2 flex leading-tight""><div class=""mt-0.5 mr-2 w-4""><svg width=""14"" height=""15"" viewBox=""0 0 14 15"" fill=""none"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg""><path d=""M14 5.58984C14 2.91016 11.8398 0.75 9.16016 0.75C6.50781 0.777344 4.375 2.91016 4.375 5.5625C4.375 6.10938 4.45703 6.60156 4.59375 7.09375L0.191406 11.4961C0.0546875 11.6328 0 11.7969 0 11.9609V14.0938C0 14.4766 0.273438 14.75 0.65625 14.75H3.71875C4.07422 14.75 4.375 14.4766 4.375 14.0938V13H5.46875C5.82422 13 6.125 12.7266 6.125 12.3438V11.25H7.13672C7.30078 11.25 7.51953 11.168 7.62891 11.0312L8.28516 10.293C8.55859 10.3477 8.85938 10.375 9.1875 10.375C11.8398 10.375 14 8.24219 14 5.58984Z"" fill=""#FFB81C""></path></svg></div><div>For safer exposure to quantum computing, consider established giants like Alphabet or Nvidia instead of pure plays like IonQ or Rigetti.</div></li><li data-pitch-row=""true"" class=""my-2 flex leading-tight""><div class=""mt-0.5 mr-2 w-4""><svg width=""14"" height=""15"" xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" viewBox=""0 0 448 512""><path d=""M224 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32V51.2C119 66 64 130.6 64 208v18.8c0 47-17.3 92.4-48.5 127.6l-7.4 8.3c-8.4 9.4-10.4 22.9-5.3 34.4S19.4 416 32 416H416c12.6 0 24-7.4 29.2-18.9s3.1-25-5.3-34.4l-7.4-8.3C401.3 319.2 384 273.9 384 226.8V208c0-77.4-55-142-128-156.8V32c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zm45.3 493.3c12-12 18.7-28.3 18.7-45.3H224 160c0 17 6.7 33.3 18.7 45.3s28.3 18.7 45.3 18.7s33.3-6.7 45.3-18.7z"" fill=""#FFB81C""></path></svg></div><div><div id=""keypoints_pitch_container"" class=""pitch-container"" data-pitch-placement-id=""_R_1ahjminr5ubmivb_"" data-pitch-placement=""keypoints_pitch"" data-testid=""pitch-container-keypoints_pitch""><div data-pitch-target=""""></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=""mx-[24px] h-[1px] border-b-[1px] border-gray-200 from-transparent to-gray-200 pt-[16px] md:-mx-[40px] md:h-[16px] md:border-b-0 md:bg-gradient-to-b md:pt-0""></div><!--/$--></section><section class=""mx-auto bg-white px-6 pt-9 sm:pt-4 md:pt-4 md:pb-8 lg:px-10""><div class=""mx-auto md:max-w-[880px] lg:max-w-[1280px]""><div class=""ad-slot-reserve ad-slot-reserve--leaderboard show-ad-label relative ad-slot-reserve--desktop mt-5 mb-5""></div><div id=""FreeStarVideoAdContainer_Mobile"" class=""ad-slot-reserve ad-slot-reserve--mobile ad-slot-reserve--primis-outstream show-ad-label relative mb-5""></div><div class=""foolcom-grid-content-sidebar mt-9""><div><div id=""article-body"" class=""article-body""><p>Stocks in the quantum computing industry went all over the place in March. <a href=""http://marketintelligence.spglobal.com/"" class=""text-cyan-900 hover:text-cyan-800"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">According to data from S&amp;P Global Market Intelligence</a>, <strong>D-Wave Quantum</strong> <span class=""ticker-mention inline-flex items-center font-bold"" data-id=""451374"">(<a href=""/quote/nyse/qbts/"" class=""font-bold hover:underline"">QBTS</a> <span class=""ml-1 text-green-900"">+6.57%</span>)</span> rose 38.7%, and <strong>Quantum Computing</strong> <span class=""ticker-mention inline-flex items-center font-bold"" data-id=""356047"">(<a href=""/quote/nasdaq/qubt/"" class=""font-bold hover:underline"">QUBT</a> <span class=""ml-1 text-green-900"">+2.62%</span>)</span> gained 31.9%. At the same time, shares of <strong>Rigetti Computing</strong> <span class=""ticker-mention inline-flex items-center font-bold"" data-id=""415273"">(<a href=""/quote/nasdaq/rgti/"" class=""font-bold hover:underline"">RGTI</a> <span class=""ml-1 text-green-900"">+4.01%</span>)</span> fell 6.4%, and <strong>IonQ</strong> <span class=""ticker-mention inline-flex items-center font-bold"" data-id=""369917"">(<a href=""/quote/nyse/ionq/"" class=""font-bold hover:underline"">IONQ</a> <span class=""ml-1 text-green-900"">+2.40%</span>)</span> took a 10.2% price cut.</p>
<p>It was a busy month, for sure:</p>
<ul>
<li>Three of these stocks reported earnings in March.</li>
<li>There was a high-profile industry conference with market-moving implications.</li>
<li>D-Wave announced an important achievement in its technology research.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=""my-6 text-2xl font-bold"">D-Wave's technical achievement versus weak financial reports</h2>
<p>Let's start with the biggest gain. On March 12, D-Wave said it had applied its annealing quantum computing systems to solve ""a useful, real-world problem.""&nbsp;The company's PR department laid it on thick, citing a ""landmark"" paper that ""unequivocally validates"" this industry-first achievement.</p>
<p>The company announced earnings the next day. Sales were flat year over year, and net losses under generally accepted accounting principles (GAAP) shrank from $0.60 to $0.15 per share.</p><div class=""my-8 lg:hidden""><div id=""foolcom_sidebar_top_mobile_container"" class=""pitch-container"" data-pitch-placement-id=""_R_4b5tminr5ubmivb_"" data-pitch-placement=""foolcom_sidebar_top"" data-testid=""pitch-container-foolcom_sidebar_top""><div data-pitch-fallback=""""><div class=""min-h-[350px] rounded border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm""><div class=""mb-3 h-4 w-2/3 rounded bg-gray-200""></div><div class=""mb-2 h-3 w-full rounded bg-gray-100""></div><div class=""h-3 w-5/6 rounded bg-gray-100""></div></div></div><div data-pitch-target=""""></div></div></div>
<p>Together with D-Wave's suddenly useful technology, investors embraced these results with open arms. The stock soared 92% in three days, pulling the rest of the industry along for a bullish ride.</p>
<section class=""shadow-card mb-[40px] border border-gray-300""><div class=""flex flex-col lg:flex-row""><div class=""relative w-full""><button class=""absolute top-2 left-2"" aria-expanded=""false""><small class=""text-sm leading-normal""><div class=""flex flex-row items-center gap-2""><svg xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" width=""24"" height=""24"" viewBox=""0 0 24 24"" fill=""none"" stroke=""currentColor"" stroke-width=""2"" stroke-linecap=""round"" stroke-linejoin=""round"" class=""lucide lucide-maximize2 h-4 w-4"" aria-hidden=""true""><polyline points=""15 3 21 3 21 9""></polyline><polyline points=""9 21 3 21 3 15""></polyline><line x1=""21"" x2=""14"" y1=""3"" y2=""10""></line><line x1=""3"" x2=""10"" y1=""21"" y2=""14""></line></svg><span class=""sr-only"">Expand</span></div></small></button><div class=""flex h-full w-full flex-row items-center gap-2 pl-[144px] lg:pl-6""><div class=""py-4 pr-4""><img alt=""IonQ Stock Quote"" loading=""lazy"" width=""64"" height=""64"" decoding=""async"" data-nimg=""1"" class=""w-full flex-none object-contain"" style=""color:transparent"" srcset=""https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Fart%2Fcompanylogos%2Fmark%2FIONQ.png&amp;w=64&amp;op=resize 1x, https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Fart%2Fcompanylogos%2Fmark%2FIONQ.png&amp;w=128&amp;op=resize 2x"" src=""https://g.foolcdn.com/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fg.foolcdn.com%2Fart%2Fcompanylogos%2Fmark%2FIONQ.png&amp;w=128&amp;op=resize""></div><div class=""pr-4""><h2 class=""text-h5 mb-0 leading-normal font-medium""><a class=""text-cyan-800 hover:text-cyan-700"" target=""_self"" href=""/quote/nyse/ionq/"">NYSE<!-- -->: <!-- -->IONQ</a></h2><div class=""text-md leading-[1] font-medium text-gray-800"">IonQ</div></div></div></div><div class=""flex items-stretch justify-end lg:w-full""><div class=""relative self-stretch bg-blue-50 bg-linear-to-b from-blue-50 to-blue-100 p-3 lg:ml-auto lg:h-full""><a class=""peer absolute inset-0 z-10"" 