ar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=16 16w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=32 32w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=48 48w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=64 64w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=96 96w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=128 128w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=256 256w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=320 320w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=384 384w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=640 640w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=750 750w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=828 828w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=1080 1080w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=1200 1200w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=1920 1920w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=2048 2048w, https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=3840 3840w"" src=""https://g.foolcdn.com/avatar/189184737/large.ashx?_w=3840""><div><div class=""text-gray-1100 mb-0 text-lg font-light"">Anders Bylund is a contributing Motley Fool media and technology analyst covering semiconductors, cloud computing, internet infrastructure, quantum computing, and streaming media. Previously, Anders was a systems administrator for Nielsen Technology and CSX, gaining hands-on experience with enterprise-class systems. He was also a freelance writer for Ars Technica, TIME, USA Today, CNN, WIRED, and AOL's Daily Finance. He holds a bachelor’s degree in English and a master’s degree in library and information sciences from Florida State University. He believes in coyotes and time as an abstract.</div><div class=""mt-5 items-center sm:flex""><a class=""mr-6 text-cyan-900 hover:text-cyan-900"" href=""/author/1484/""><span class=""font-medium"">TMFZahrim</span></a><div class=""flex items-center gap-2""><svg class=""h-5 w-5 te